Welcome to our Academy
At Harris Academy Merton we promote the ethos “Achievement is Success.”
We believe every student has the right to the highest standard of education so that they can accomplish their aspirations. Our aim is to give every student an educational experience that is enjoyable and holistic so that they develop into responsible, articulate and successful young people.
